# Simple Sales Dashboard Design

## Project Overview
This project presents an interactive sales dashboard
created using Microsoft Excel.

## Objective
To analyze sales performance by product category,
region, and month.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- PivotTables
- PivotCharts
- Interactive Slicers

## Dashboard Features
- Total Sales KPI
- Total Profit KPI
- Total Units Sold KPI
- Top-Performing Region KPI
- Sales by Region chart
- Sales by Product Category chart
- Monthly Sales Trend chart
- Interactive region and date filters

## Project Files
- Sales_Dashboard.xlsx
- Dashboard_User_Guide.docx

## Conclusion
The dashboard helps users understand sales trends,
compare regional performance, and identify
high-performing product categories.
